# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# YouTube Data API v3 key — the app's entire content source.
#
# Get one:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com  ->  create (or pick) a project
#   2. APIs & Services -> Library -> enable "YouTube Data API v3"
#   3. APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create credentials -> API key
#   4. Recommended: restrict the key to the YouTube Data API v3, and under
#      "Application restrictions" add an HTTP referrer for http://localhost:5173/*
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_, and only reads this file at
# startup — restart `npm run dev` after changing it.
#
# Quota note: 10,000 units/day, and a search costs 100 units (~100 searches/day).
# Results are cached in localStorage for 12h to stay well inside that.
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
